# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# VKAI Panel - giao dien quan tri (panel/, Next.js)
# HiTechCloud - https://hitechcloud.vn
#
# Sao chep tep nay thanh .env.local (khi phat trien) hoac .env.production
# (khi build ban chay that) TRUOC khi chay `npm run build`.
#
# LUU Y QUAN TRONG: NEXT_PUBLIC_* la bien duoc nhung thang vao bundle
# TAI THOI DIEM BUILD, khong phai luc chay. Cap bien sau khi build se khong
# co tac dung.
#
# Cac bien VKAI_* (VKAI_PANEL_PORT, VKAI_PANEL_ENTRANCE, VKAI_PANEL_BIND, ...)
# thuoc ve dich vu API trong core/ - xem core/.env.example, khong khai bao o day.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# URL goc cua API (dich vu vkai-api trong core/), tinh theo goc nhin cua
# TRINH DUYET (khong phai hostname noi bo cua Docker).
#
# - De TRONG (khuyen nghi) khi co nginx dat truoc va proxy /api -> vkai-api:
#     NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=
#   Khi do giao dien goi same-origin: /api/v1/...
#
# - Dat URL tuyet doi khi giao dien va API nam o hai ten mien / cong khac nhau:
#     NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=https://panel.example.com
NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=
